evals_*/
# ...but antiGen-figures ships pooled eval folders that must be tracked: a
# figure has to be reproducible from the commit that adds it.
!antiGen-figures/data/evals_sc2/
!antiGen-figures/data/evals_sc2_lists_macro/
!antiGen-figures/data/evals_sc2_lists_varrecall/
!antiGen-figures/data/evals_sc2_mtb/
!antiGen-figures/data/evals_sc2_lists_macro_backbone/
# The 20-letter arm on the revised corpus (NOTES s54). The "recall rows only"
# note here was true at s54 and went stale: s66 gave the yield row a substrate
# (antiGen-data-revised's dated BA.2 count files) and s73 is building the
# background row. The varrecall directory was never added alongside its macro
# sibling, so `list_variant_recall.csv` ended up TRACKED INSIDE AN IGNORED
# DIRECTORY -- `git status` reports it as modified and `git add <path>` refuses
# it, which is a confusing pair of answers to get about one file (NOTES s76).
!antiGen-figures/data/evals_sc2_aa20/
!antiGen-figures/data/evals_sc2_lists_macro_aa20/
!antiGen-figures/data/evals_sc2_lists_varrecall_aa20/
!antiGen-figures/data/evals_sc2_background_aa20/
!antiGen-figures/data/evals_sc2_background_aa20_2023-01-01/
!antiGen-figures/data/evals_sc2_background_aa20_2023-01-01_eventwtd/
# sc2_results_revised2 panels I-L (NOTES s125).
!antiGen-figures/data/evals_sc2_lists_macro_aa20_2023-01-01_allcells/
!antiGen-figures/data/evals_sc2_lists_macro_aa20_2023-01-01_fullspike/
# supp_fixed_split: one list run per baseline cutoff (NOTES s126).
!antiGen-figures/data/evals_fixedsplit_*/
# The background contrast (the list figures' K-L). Small summary CSVs, not the
# ~7 MB/model score matrices those are derived from, which stay outside the repo.
!antiGen-figures/data/evals_sc2_background/
!antiGen-figures/data/evals_sc2_background_q0.05/
!antiGen-figures/data/evals_sc2_background_q0.20/
# NOTE: do not blanket-ignore *.csv — data/baselines*/ and data/toy/ ship tracked CSVs.
# Eval/training outputs are written outside the repo (or to the ignored dirs above).

